{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-03_beg","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-03","title":"麥稈，極易燃燒","storyCode":"R8-3","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"531a4d76e4e97dad083ee8aa3034ef739ffdb543762122bbb696f31606d18b49","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"暉潔：\n接著上次那件事說。\n我逃了很久，逃到一個小村子裡。\n我當時沒想那麼多，只是想找個地方藏起來，沒想到我真的找到了一個棲身之所。\n這一對老夫婦，可能是把我當做了他們的女兒。畢竟烏薩斯那麼多場戰爭，他們的子女可能很早就犧牲了。\n就連我的秘密他們也幫忙藏住了。\n我想我怎麼報答他們都不過分。\n遺憾的是，我沒能好好報答他們。\n1月13日"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次的例行檢查中，我們有一個隊員遭到了襲擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，每一戶都要接受搜查。不僅是感染者，一旦我們發現襲擊者，我們會立刻擊殺他們，而窩藏他們的村戶，也會受到懲罰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"不想服苦役的話，就告發他們。沒人會因為你們光榮的報告受到傷害，而罪犯和感染者將得到他們應有的下場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，從第一戶開始。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"老奶奶，這一天還是來了。我肯定是躲不過的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"別出去，塔露拉！藏在草棚後面......他們不會查的！我們就說你害怕受到懲罰，逃跑了！沒有人會怪你的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"可你們會被傷害的。這不該是我報答你們的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我留下了一點金幣......這些是維多利亞金幣，你們省著點花，一定夠你們這輩子吃飽穿暖的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，塔露拉！你要去哪？我的塔露拉......不可以，你不可以和他們見面啊！這些糾察隊的黑蟲子吃人不眨眼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"所以不能讓他們再壓榨村子裡的叔叔阿姨了。這種事應該有個結束。我會引開他們，警醒他們，我會讓他們知道後果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道分寸的，老奶奶。我可不會讓他們借機報復，再殺害村子裡的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我還記得隔壁的弟弟只是因為扔了個石頭就被活活打死。我忘不掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉......塔露拉！別這麼說......別這麼說！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"誰！誰在敲門......是糾察隊嗎！走開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老媽媽，是我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"阿麗娜！快進來，快進來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？發生什麼事了？有消息嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"......有人告密了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？什麼？什麼告密？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"糾察隊知道我們村子裡有一個感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能，不會這樣的......啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道他們從哪裡得來的消息，但是我們都明白包藏感染者的下場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"老媽媽，我爸爸去世得早，媽媽也全賴你們照顧，我把你們就當是我自己的爺爺奶奶一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"到現在這個關頭，我也沒什麼好隱瞞的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"——等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，爺爺他去了哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"臭老頭子，你是來做什麼的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我犯了罪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"自首？啊，對，我記得了。我們那個隊員是被一個老頭攔下了。看你這一瘸一拐的，你就是當時的襲擊者之一吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"對！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"......看你也沒什麼油水可敲。有多遠滾多遠吧。那個小伙子也是不知好歹，跟窮農民吵什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"不止。老爺，你看看我身上這塊，你看像什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者！感染者就是你？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"我當時給你換衣服的時候，都看到啦......塔露拉，你是感染者，我和老頭子知道很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"那——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"老頭子去礦場賺點錢，也是染了礦石病才回來的！你看他一直穿著他那個夾克不肯脫掉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"老頭子是要替你頂罪啊，塔露拉......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"這豈不是說爺爺他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"村子裡那些人都信不過的！只要是為了錢，為了保命，他們什麼事都能往外說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩年，塔露拉，我們真的很喜歡你！你是個好孩子......是個好孩子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也沒幾天好活了，但是你，塔露拉，就算得了病，你也是能再多活幾年的！你得好好活著才行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老婦","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，別去！別去啊......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"抓我走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺，抓我走吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你看我這身上！我才是那個得了病的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"不信的話，你就看看這個吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"刀？把刀放下。老頭，你傷不到我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"不，老爺，你看看我的法術......你看看我的法術！"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人切開了自己的手腕，紅色沒有流進雪地，而是像霧一樣彌散在空氣中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，你看......老爺！我是貨真價實的感染者！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_25"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者糾察隊","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝你的合作，感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......唔......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉！回來！別去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......火？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼？！為什麼房子燒起來了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉！這是你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿麗娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_079","isRemote":false,"text":"不要去！！塔露拉！！這樣整個村子都會遭殃的！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
